<https://w3id.org/lmodel/spdx/endOfSupport> linkml:description "there is a defined end of support for the artifact from the supplier. This may also be referred to as end of life. There is a validUntilDate that can be used to signal when support ends for the artifact." ;
	linkml:meaning "spdx_core:SupportType/endOfSupport"^^xsd:anyURI .
