	dcterms:title "System Package Data Exchange (SPDX)" ;
	pav:version "3.0.1" ;
	a linkml:SchemaDefinition ;
	rdfs:seeAlso "https://lmodel.github.io/spdx"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://spdx.dev/specifications/"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v3.0.1/"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "The element descriptions are the model's rdfs:comment texts, which the SPDX Project publishes under the Community Specification License 1.0." , "The model's individuals (NoAssertionElement, NoneElement, NoAssertionLicense, NoneLicense and SpdxOrganization) are instance data, not schema. A reference to one is an IRI like any other Element reference." , "scripts/spdx_to_linkml.py writes every YAML file in this folder from the vendored model, upstream/spdx-model.ttl. Change the script or the model, never the files." , "spdx_core imports only the LinkML types, each profile module imports the modules it references, and this file adds nothing of its own, so an importer can import one profile alone." ;
